Number = {1},
Month = {JAN 10},
Abstract = {In this essay, we will present arguments for a negative answer to the
   debate question: ``Is publishing ethnobiology data respectful of
   Indigenous and Local Knowledge holders' rights?{''} We recognize that
   ethnobiological research has advanced in recognizing the rights of
   Indigenous Peoples and Local Communities (IPLC), but we believe that we
   still have a long way to go in deconstructing colonialism in
   ethnobiology. In order to be truly respectful, ethnobiologists need to
   collaborate with IPLC to achieve an ethical science with equity between
   knowledge systems, fostering the co-production of knowledge from an
   intercultural science perspective. This essay was written by a group of
   Brazilian scientists, both IPLC and non-IPLC, and reflects a perspective
   of the academic universe seen from the place we are, in this
   multicultural and imbalanced world.},
